-6.106 6.427-6.106h6.27c.766 0 1.181.405 1.181 1.173v1.109c.001 2.002 1.35 3.413 3.352 3.413h12.605c2.054 0 3.34-1.411 3.34-3.413v-1.11c0-.766.415-1.171 1.183-1.171h6.228c4.141-.001 6.427 2.172 6.427 6.106v75.417c0 3.933-2.286 6.116-6.427 6.116Zm6.775-3.581h20.712c1.296 0 2.27-.924 2.27-2.282s-.973-2.27-2.269-2.27H21.055c-1.358 0-2.27.912-2.27 2.27s.912 2.282 2.27 2.282"></path></svg></div> <div class="platform-label">iPhone</div></div> </section>  <div class="divider svelte-j9g7ud"></div> <section data-test-id="shelf-wrapper" class="shelf svelte-1svznay centered   padding-top padding-bottom"> <p class="svelte-158dia6"> <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 5);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353"><span dir="auto" class="svelte-158dia6"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Booksy is the booking app and business tool for beauty pros doing it on their own. Side-hustlers turned full-timers. Commissioned turned independent. Solo pros building a name behind the chair. And the salon owners building something bigger. Every feature built with you in mind. Every feature included.

Booksy is the top online scheduling and client management platform for appointment-based businesses.

Easy for you to run. Easy for your clients to love.

WHAT YOU GET WITH BOOKSY BIZ

GET BOOKED 24/7, EVEN WHEN YOU SLEEP
Clients book themselves through your booking site, Instagram, Google, and Facebook. They love how easy it is to book, reschedule, and rebook. You set the rules, the hours, and the prices. We handle the rest. 

STOP GETTING GHOSTED
Set your cancellation policy and we’ll enforce it for you. Charge deposits, charge cancellation fees, fill empty slots automatically from the waitlist. No more chasing payments. No more awkward texts. Pros using Booksy recovered over $15.6 million from no-shows last year.

GET PAID FAST, SECURE, AND YOUR WAY
Take card, tap, mobile wallet, or in-app payments. Powered by Stripe. Free next-business-day payouts, or cash out in under 30 minutes with Fast Payouts. Every transaction is tracked and reported in one place - no more juggling multiple payment apps disconnected from your business.

BUILD THE CLIENT BASE THAT KEEPS YOU BUSY 
Free text and email marketing. Promotions to fill slow days. Loyalty cards to reward your regulars. Automated rebooking reminders so they never lapse. 

LOOK LIKE THE PROFESSIONAL YOU ARE 
Your booking site, portfolio, and verified reviews build trust before clients even book. Show off your work, display your prices, and let your reviews do the talking.

GET FOUND BY CLIENTS SEARCHING NEARBY
Your business gets listed on the Booksy marketplace. Show up in Google Search, Google Maps, and Google AI Mode. Add a Book Now button to Instagram, Facebook, and Google. The clients are already searching — you just need to show up and make it easy to book. That’s where we come in.

RUN THE WHOLE THING FROM YOUR PHONE 
Calendar, client cards, payments, marketing, reports — all in one app. Log in on the web or tablet for a complete front desk experience.

GROW YOUR TEAM. STAY IN CONTROL.
Add staff, manage shifts, set commissions, track performance. Build a system that runs without you in the room — while you stay in complete control of how it operates. Booksy grows with you, from solo to salon and beyond.

ONE PRICE, EVERY FEATURE INCLUDED
No plan tiers. No paywalls. No "upgrade for that feature." Every Booksy subscription includes scheduling, marketing, payments, reports, and 24/7 support. You only pay more if you add staff. 

ABOUT BOOST 
Boost is the optional marketing tool to get you in front of more clients on the Booksy marketplace. We charge 30% of the FIRST visit from a Boost client only. Every appointment after that is 100% yours. We do not charge for appointments from existing clients, or for any client bookings when Boost is off.

REAL HUMAN SUPPORT, 24/7
Live chat in under 30 seconds. Phone and email support during business hours. We also offer 1:1 personal onboarding and transfer your data over for FREE. 

THE NUMBERS
• 330,000+ pros trust Booksy worldwide
• 9.52 appointments created every second
• $15.6 million protected from no-shows last year
• 4.9 stars from 740,000+ reviews on the consumer app

Try free for 14-days, no credit card required. Cancel anytime.
Try Booksy Biz today<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></span></span> </div> <button class="svelte-158dia6">more</button></p> </section> <section id="productRatings" data-test-id="shelf-wrapper" aria-label="Ratings &amp; Reviews" class="shelf svelte-1svznay    padding-top">  <div class="title-action-wrapper svelte-1oivr99">  <a aria-label="Ratings &amp; Reviews" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/725335996?see-all=reviews&amp;platform=iphone" data-test-id="internal-link" class="svelte-jrkm1h"><div class="link-contents svelte-1oivr99"><h2 class="shelf-title svelte-1oivr99" data-test-id="shelf-title">Ratings &amp; Reviews</h2> <span class="chevron-container svelte-1oivr99" data-test-id="shelf-see-all-chevron" aria-hidden="true">   <svg viewBox="0 0 51.108 87.687" aria-hidden="false"><path d="M51.108 43.834c-.018-1.997-.718-3.638-2.334-5.23L11.214 1.877C9.974.6 8.453 0 6.64 0 2.96 0 .001 2.897.001 6.55 0 8.326.765 10.004 2.068 11.344l33.398 32.472L2.07 76.325C.784 77.665 0 79.305 0 81.137c0 3.653 2.96 6.55 6.641 6.55 1.796 0 3.334-.601 4.572-1.877l37.561-36.746c1.636-1.591 2.334-3.25 2.334-5.23"></path></svg></span></div> </a></div>    <ul style="--grid-max-content-xsmall: 298px; --grid-column-gap-xsmall: 10px; --grid-row-gap-xsmall: 24px; --grid-small: 2; --grid-column-gap-small: 20px; --grid-row-gap-small: 24px; --grid-medium: 2; --grid-column-gap-medium: 20px; --grid-row-gap-medium: 24px; --grid-large: 3; --grid-column-gap-large: 20px; --grid-row-gap-large: 24px; --grid-xlarge: 3; --grid-column-gap-xlarge: 20px; --grid-row-gap-xlarge: 24px;" class="grid svelte-7iyek8" data-test-id="grid"><li><div class="svelte-102wyj3"><div class="amp-rating svelte-z92vmb" data-testid="rating-component"> <div class="stats svelte-z92vmb" role="text"><div class="stats__main svelte-z92vmb" data-testid="amp-rating__average-rating">4.5</div> <div class="stats__total svelte-z92vmb" data-testid="amp-rating__total-text">out of 5</div></div> <div class="numbers svelte-z92vmb"><div class="numbers__count s