1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166"></path></svg> </li> </ol></div></div> <div class="review-header svelte-1b79zq6"><time class="date svelte-1b79zq6" datetime="2024-10-09T11:20:45.000Z">10/09/2024</time>  <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353"><span class="author svelte-1b79zq6">KaylaMae123</span></span> </div></div></div> <div class="content svelte-1b79zq6">  <div class="truncate-wrapper svelte-1b6lxg0"><p data-testid="truncate-text" dir="auto" class="content svelte-1b6lxg0" style="--lines: 3; --line-height: var(--lineHeight, 16); --link-length: 4;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->I’m a Stylist of 10 years in the hair industry. I have recently ventured out into my own Salon! Booksy has been a major help! My experience has been made easy with the exceptional support from the team! Gabi was a team member that helped me through the set up process and making my profile look professional! She did an amazing job double checking everything over! My clients experience has been that it’s very easy to use and very straightforward when it comes to finding what they are looking for. I tried out other apps to ensure which would be best for my business. Booksy is the right choice for not only myself but my clients as well. Thank you to the Booksy team for always being on top of it and for always making sure everything is running smoothly! You guys truly have answered all my questions and then some! The advice and kindness I have received from each member has honestly been a game changer! It’s awesome to know that I have a great support team on my side whenever! I also appreciate the efforts made when I’ve made suggestions upon features within the App. I’m truly satisfied! Thank you again!<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div>  <div class="developer-response-container svelte-1b79zq6"><span class="developer-response-heading svelte-1b79zq6">Developer Response</span>   <div class="truncate-wrapper svelte-1b6lxg0"><p data-testid="truncate-text" dir="auto" class="content svelte-1b6lxg0" style="--lines: 1; --line-height: var(--lineHeight, 16); --link-length: 4;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->We’re grateful for your review! Thank you!<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div> </div></div></div>  <dialog data-testid="dialog" class="svelte-1p01z7" id="" aria-hidden="true"><div data-testid="content-modal" class="content-modal-container svelte-1ih6d3u" dir="auto"><div class="button-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><button data-testid="content-modal-close-button" class="close-button svelte-1ih6d3u" type="button" aria-label="Close"><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 18 18" data-testid="content-modal-close-button-svg"><path d="M1.2 18C.6 18 0 17.5 0 16.8c0-.4.1-.6.4-.8l7-7-7-7c-.3-.2-.4-.5-.4-.8C0 .5.6 0 1.2 0c.3 0 .6.1.8.3l7 7 7-7c.2-.2.5-.3.8-.3.6 0 1.2.5 1.2 1.2 0 .3-.1.6-.4.8l-7 7 7 7c.2.2.4.5.4.8 0 .7-.6 1.2-1.2 1.2-.3 0-.6-.1-.8-.3l-7-7-7 7c-.2.1-.5.3-.8.3"></path></svg></button> </div> <div class="header-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><h1 data-testid="content-modal-title" class="title svelte-1ih6d3u">Booksy App and Team</h1> </div> <div class="content-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><div class="container svelte-1b79zq6 is-detail-view" aria-labelledby="review-11814245180-title" dir="ltr"><div class="header svelte-1b79zq6"><div class="title-and-rating-container svelte-1b79zq6"> <div style="display: contents; --fill-color:var(--systemOrange); --star-size:24px;"><ol class="stars svelte-1fdd9o7" aria-label="5 Stars"><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.