0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166m3.87-5.321c-.054-.054-.027-.081 0-.242l5.349-15.374c.376-1.049.161-1.882-.78-2.527L8.613 27.341c-.134-.08-.161-.134-.134-.215s.08-.08.242-.08l16.26.295c1.103.027 1.802-.43 2.151-1.532l4.677-15.562c.027-.162.08-.215.134-.215.08 0 .135.053.162.215l4.676 15.562c.35 1.102 1.048 1.559 2.15 1.532l16.261-.296c.162 0 .216 0 .243.081.027.08-.027.134-.135.215l-13.385 9.246c-.94.645-1.156 1.478-.78 2.527l5.35 15.374c.026.161.053.188 0 .242-.055.08-.135.026-.243-.054l-12.928-9.864c-.86-.672-1.855-.672-2.715 0l-12.928 9.864c-.107.08-.188.134-.242.054"></path></svg> </li> </ol></div></div> <div class="review-header svelte-1b79zq6"><time class="date svelte-1b79zq6" datetime="2026-02-05T07:51:44.000Z">Feb 5</time>  <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353"><span class="author svelte-1b79zq6">Madame Yoshee</span></span> </div></div></div> <div class="content svelte-1b79zq6">  <div class="truncate-wrapper svelte-1b6lxg0"><p data-testid="truncate-text" dir="auto" class="content svelte-1b6lxg0" style="--lines: 3; --line-height: var(--lineHeight, 16); --link-length: 4;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->I had to cancel my account because of clients booking and not showing. I had no show policy in place and even switched to deposit. Despite all of these precautions I still wasted time and money. Eventually leading to booksy blocking my boost and receiving fewer and fewer new clients. I started a new account and the booking issues continued on this account. Leading me to being charged for a no show I didn't know I had. No notifications from booksy on the booksy app about the client or the charge. I noticed because I an extra charge had occurred in my bank account from booksy. I searched everywhere but saw no reason for the charge until I check my client list as I was about to import my clients to another platform. And that's when I saw it; a client I had never seen. They never booked, so I thought. After examining their profile I see their appointment was only a few days prior. Deposit in place; failed charge; no notification and it had not been on my books that day. Side note: I check everyday all day religiously; I had problems with not receiving push notifications from booksy. I reached out to customer service and they offered no resolution only preventative measures; which I had already done. On another point they raised the cap level for 1st time boost services; it was set at 30% up to $50 now if I'm not mistaken it's up to $100 or more. Luckily for me this was my back up booking app. Styleseat is better and they only take up to $50.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div>  <div class="developer-response-container svelte-1b79zq6"><span class="developer-response-heading svelte-1b79zq6">Developer Response</span>   <div class="truncate-wrapper svelte-1b6lxg0"><p data-testid="truncate-text" dir="auto" class="content svelte-1b6lxg0" style="--lines: 1; --line-height: var(--lineHeight, 16); --link-length: 4;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Thank you for sharing your thoughts. We apologize that your experience didn’t meet your expectations. <!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div> </div></div></div>  <dialog data-testid="dialog" class="svelte-1p01z7" id="" aria-hidden="true"><div data-testid="content-modal" class="content-modal-container svelte-1ih6d3u" dir="auto"><div class="button-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><button data-testid="content-modal-close-button" class="close-button svelte-1ih6d