s-also-bought-apps%5D=40&sparseLimit%5Bapps%3Adeveloper-other-apps%5D=40&sparseLimit%5Bapps%3Arelated-editorial-items%5D=40&limit%5Breviews%5D=8&l=en-US","destination":{"storefront":"us","language":"en-US","$kind":"ProductPageIntent","id":"1179146771","platform":"iphone"}},"impressionMetrics":{"fields":{"id":"1179146771","name":"Acuity: Appointment Scheduler","impressionType":"lockup","idType":"its_id","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","platformDisplayStyle":"ios","impressionIndex":1,"contentRating":416,"bundleId":"com.acuityscheduling.app.ios"}}},{"$kind":"Lockup","adamId":"1081286979","bundleId":"com.glossgenius.GlossGeniusSaaS","decorations":[],"icon":{"$kind":"Artwork","backgroundColor":{"red":0.06666666666666667,"green":0.06666666666666667,"blue":0.06666666666666667,"type":"rgb"},"textColor":{"red":0.8470588235294118,"green":0.6666666666666666,"blue":0.403921568627451,"type":"rgb"},"style":"roundedRectPrerendered","crop":"bb","contentMode":null,"imageScale":null,"template":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/3a/53/f5/3a53f507-16bc-9648-031d-115decaa47e9/Placeholder.mill/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}","width":1024,"height":1024,"variants":[{"$kind":"ArtworkVariant","format":"jpeg","quality":70,"supportsWideGamut":false}]},"title":"GlossGenius: Booking, Payments","isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible":true,"useAdsLocale":false,"subtitle":"Scheduling, Checkout, More","tertiaryTitle":"Designed for iPad","tertiaryTitleAction":null,"tertiaryTitleArtwork":null,"developerTagline":"Scheduling, Checkout, More","ageRating":"4+","productDescription":"GlossGenius is the system 120,000+ beauty, wellness, and health businesses trust to earn more revenue and get more time back.\n\nWhy GlossGenius? \n \nGet more new clients \nYour booking site ranks on Google, so new clients find you when they're searching — no paid ads required. Automated confirmations and reminders keep no-shows off your calendar. And 24/7 online booking fills your schedule while you're with clients, at dinner, or asleep.\n \nEarn more from every appointment\nOther point-of-sale systems just process payments. GlossGenius is the only point-of-sale that earns you more. Keep more of what you make with our low, flat 2.6% rate and no hidden fees. Grow your average ticket value with features like Buy Now, Pay Later, Memberships, and Packages that make it easier for clients to spend more. Take payments from anywhere with Tap to Pay on iOS or our GlossGenius card readers. And quickly access your earnings with free same-business-day transfers.\n \nPut busywork on autopilot\nOther systems give you more to do. GlossGenius does more work for you. Staff calendars, cancellations, and waitlists run themselves. Payroll takes minutes: commissions, tips, and team pay are calculated and tracked automatically. One dashboard shows your top services, most valuable clients, and revenue at a glance. Your Growth Analyst works 24/7 to spot and surface growth opportunities, so your business can keep earning, even when you’re off the clock. \n \nKeep clients coming back\n60% of clients who leave without a next appointment won't rebook on their own. Other tools leave that to you. GlossGenius makes sure they come back, without you having to ask. Clients get prompted to rebook at checkout while the experience is still fresh. Automated reminders go out when they're due for a visit — no chasing required. AI-powered Email & Text Marketing makes it easy to draft campaigns to hook clients who have drifted. Memberships & Packages give your best clients a reason to keep coming back.  \n\nDedicated support, whenever you need it\nWe treat your business like it’s our own. Our team knows beauty, wellness, and health businesses inside and out and is available by text, phone, and email.\n \nWe’ll take care of transferring your data for you. Free.\nWe'll transfer your client list, appointments, and notes from your current system at no charge. No manual re-entry, no starting over.\n\nGlossGenius is trusted by 120,000+ businesses for: \n•  Intuitive appointment scheduling and calendar management \n•  The industry's lowest flat processing rate — 2.6%, no hidden fees \n•  Custom booking websites that help you rank higher online\n•  Automated reminders that prevent no-shows\n•  Automated Waitlist that protects you from last-minute cancellations\n•  AI-powered marketing and unlimited emails, free\n•  Free same-business-day payment transfers\nAnd more! \n\nWhat our members are saying\n\n“Switching from Mangomint to Glossgenius was a no-brainer. GlossGenius has opened up so many opportunities to grow my business.” - Ellishea L.\n\n“I wouldn’t be able to generate the dollars that I make behind the chair without GlossGenius. No one has the time to do all that GlossGenius does without extremely high overhead.” - Christopher P.\n \n“What I used to make in three months, I made in one day. It was insane. It completely changed my business.” Yolanda O.\n \n“Obsessed with GlossGenius. This is a game-changer for the industry, acts as your own personal assistant! I thought switching over was bold, but it was so easy. They transferred all of my data from Square.” - The Wildflower Collective\n\n“Moving over from Vagaro was seamless and faster than I even thought. Genius is an understatement.” -Kathy R.\n\n“No more hidden fees, no more paying extra for a specific time slot, no auto checkout, no more BS! I’ve tried a lot of other solutions, and GlossGenius is hands down the best!” - Megan H.\t","rating":4.5,"ratingCount":"4.3K","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=1081286979&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=891096996"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType