"storefront":"us","language":"en-US","$kind":"ProductPageIntent","id":"665859578","platform":"iphone"}},"impressionMetrics":{"fields":{"id":"665859578","name":"Setmore Appointment Scheduling","impressionType":"lockup","idType":"its_id","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","platformDisplayStyle":"ios","impressionIndex":4,"contentRating":100,"bundleId":"com.setmore.app"}}},{"$kind":"Lockup","adamId":"346778559","bundleId":"com.vagaro.vagaropro","decorations":[],"icon":{"$kind":"Artwork","backgroundColor":{"red":0.792156862745098,"green":0.43137254901960786,"blue":0.32941176470588235,"type":"rgb"},"textColor":{"red":0.03137254901960784,"green":0.011764705882352941,"blue":0.011764705882352941,"type":"rgb"},"style":"roundedRectPrerendered","crop":"bb","contentMode":null,"imageScale":null,"template":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/59/d5/eb/59d5eb31-90af-df62-07ae-cc3bff301335/Placeholder.mill/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}","width":1024,"height":1024,"variants":[{"$kind":"ArtworkVariant","format":"jpeg","quality":70,"supportsWideGamut":false}]},"title":"Vagaro Pro","isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible":false,"useAdsLocale":false,"subtitle":"Booking, Payments, Scheduling","tertiaryTitle":null,"tertiaryTitleAction":null,"tertiaryTitleArtwork":null,"developerTagline":"Booking, Payments, Scheduling","ageRating":"4+","productDescription":"The all-in-one app built for independent professionals and growing teams to manage appointments, clients, sales, and marketing – from your chair, suite, or studio! \r\n\r\n\nTake Control of Your Schedule & Impress Every Client: \n\n\r\n\r\nEffortless Online Booking: No more phone tag or DMs! Let your clients book appointments 24/7 through a personalized booking page that feels like your brand. Whether you’re renting a booth, running your own studio, or managing a growing team, clients can easily find available time slots, schedule services, and even pre-pay for appointments – all without needing to call you. \n\n\r\n\r\nSeamless Calendar Management: Say goodbye to messy paper calendars and scattered appointment books. Vagaro Pro provides a clear, drag-and-drop calendar that makes managing your schedule effortless – no matter how many clients or locations you handle. Easily view your day, week, or month at a glance. Double- or triple-book when needed, manage booth renter schedules with color-coding, and send automated reminders to reduce no-shows. \r\n\r\n\nPowerful Client Management: Keep every client detail in one secure place – from contact info and service history to favorite styles and notes about preferences or allergies. Vagaro Pro helps independent pros and small teams build loyalty through personalized care and thoughtful service touches. \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBoost Income & Build a Scalable Business: \r\n\r\nStreamline Your Operations: Vagaro Pro is more than a booking app – it’s your digital business partner. From calendar management and marketing to payments and reports, Vagaro helps solo artists, booth renters, and growing beauty entrepreneurs stay organized and scale with confidence. \r\n\r\nSell Online & Earn While You Sleep: Launch your own online store to sell memberships, packages, products, and gift cards – even when you’re off the clock. Perfect for solopreneurs building passive income or studios adding new revenue streams. Join FREE today and list your business on the Marketplace to get found, booked & paid! \r\n\r\n\nIntroducing the Revolutionary AI Description Generator: \r\n\r\nEffortless Content Creation: Struggle writing service descriptions or bios? Vagaro Pro’s built-in AI description generator helps you sound polished and professional in seconds. Create service menus, class descriptions, and policies that match your vibe – friendly, professional, or casual – and never waste time writing again. \r\n\r\n\nNever Lose Data Again & Always Stay Connected: \r\n\r\nAutomatic Sync & Backup: Whether you work solo or manage a small team, Vagaro Pro keeps your data safe and accessible across all devices. Switch seamlessly between your phone, tablet, and laptop with confidence knowing your business info is always backed up. \r\n\r\n\nSupport That Feels Personal: Get real help when you need it. Vagaro’s friendly support team is available 7 days a week by phone, chat, or email – ready to assist independent professionals, booth renters, and owners alike. \n\n\r\n\r\nPowerful Reporting & Insights at Your Fingertips: \r\n\r\nMake Smart, Confident Business Decisions: Track income, monitor bookings, and discover trends to grow smarter every month. Vagaro’s easy reports show what’s working so you can focus more on clients and less on spreadsheets. \n\r\n\r\n\nJoin over 220,000 beauty, wellness, and fitness professionals who trust Vagaro Pro to run their business their way! \r\n\r\n\nDownload Vagaro Pro today and see how it can transform your solo career, suite, or growing brand! \r\n\r\n\nP.S. Still using paper appointment books? There’s a better way. Download Vagaro Pro now and see why it’s the go-to choice for booth renters, solopreneurs, and growing pros who want to work smarter – not harder. ","rating":4.4,"ratingCount":"16K","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=346778559&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=891540751"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"346778559"},{"locationPosition":5,"locationType":"lockup","name":"Vagaro Pro","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"346778559"},{"locationPosition":16,"locationType":"similarItems","name":"You Might Also Like","idType":"relationship","id":"customers-also-bought-apps"}],"jet_adamId":"346778559","eventType