"You Might Also Like","impressionType":"similarItems","idType":"relationship","impressionIndex":17}},"contentType":"smallLockup","marker":null,"items":[{"$kind":"Lockup","adamId":"1023050786","bundleId":"com.squareup.appointments","decorations":[],"icon":{"$kind":"Artwork","backgroundColor":{"red":0.4823529411764706,"green":0.6823529411764706,"blue":0.2,"type":"rgb"},"textColor":{"red":0.08235294117647059,"green":0.08235294117647059,"blue":0.07450980392156863,"type":"rgb"},"style":"roundedRectPrerendered","crop":"bb","contentMode":null,"imageScale":null,"template":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/8f/19/38/8f193865-09da-0946-9bcb-15928d055c16/Placeholder.mill/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}","width":1024,"height":1024,"variants":[{"$kind":"ArtworkVariant","format":"jpeg","quality":70,"supportsWideGamut":false}]},"title":"Square Appointments: Scheduler","isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible":false,"useAdsLocale":false,"subtitle":"Book, Schedule, Get Payments","tertiaryTitle":null,"tertiaryTitleAction":null,"tertiaryTitleArtwork":null,"developerTagline":"Book, Schedule, Get Payments","ageRating":"4+","productDescription":"Square Appointments is an all-in-one solution for booking and scheduling appointments, sending reminders, and accepting payments.\n\n\n► THE ALL-IN ONE POINT OF SALE FOR BOOKING, PAYMENTS, AND MORE\nIt has everything you need to run your business from anywhere: online booking that’s easy for you and your customers, a point of sale that tracks customer details, and a secure, fast payment system. There are three monthly plans: Free, Plus, and Premium, and each is on a per-location basis. Custom pricing is available for businesses that process over $250K in annual revenue.\n\n► NO CREDIT CARD REQUIRED, NO LONG-TERM COMMITMENTS\nGet 24/7 online booking, automatic appointment reminders, seamless payment processing, and no-show protection with Square Appointments for iPhone, iPad, and desktop. This is especially beneficial for barbershops and nail salons that need to manage appointments efficiently.\n\n► PRICING PLANS TO FIT YOUR BUSINESS\nPricing for Square Appointments is based on the features that fit your business best. There are three monthly plans: Free, Plus, and Premium, and each is on a per-location basis. Custom pricing is available for businesses that process over $250K in annual revenue.\n\n► LET CLIENTS BOOK 24/7\nNo website? No problem—Square Appointments includes a pre-built booking site, so your customers can book anytime, from anywhere. Easily manage and accept bookings from your iPhone or iPad. With our Square Online integration, you can customize layouts, colors, and fonts that reflect your brand and even add pages for products, testimonials, and more. This feature is perfect for nail salons and barbershops looking to enhance their online presence.\n\n► CHECK OUT CLIENTS SEAMLESSLY\nAccept payments, sell products, or send invoices easily, all from one app. Let customers have Square save their card on file for even faster checkout.\n\n► REDUCE NO-SHOWS\nSet up automated appointment reminders, request prepayment or charge a cancellation fee for online booking.\n\n► MANAGE AN ENTIRE TEAM EASILY\nManage your whole team’s calendars, set their access and permissions, and see individual sales and appointment reports all from one place.\n\n► GET TO KNOW YOUR CLIENTS\nKeep notes on all your clients so you can keep track of their preferences, appointment and sales history. This is valuable for barbershops, nail salons, and health & beauty businesses aiming to provide personalized services.\n\n\nThis is more than just a calendar. Square Appointments is powerful appointment scheduling, a point of sale, and payment processing—all in one place.","rating":4.9,"ratingCount":"195K","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAda